{"3844870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hope Company", "steam_appid": 3844870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope Company is a Fantasy medieval wave attack game based on combat and a evolving story. </strong>Taking inspiration from Bloon's Tower Defence 6, Mud and Blood and Battle Brothers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the game you start as a Mercenary company commander.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a range of damage dealers, immovable tanks, healers and supporters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle environments like snowy hills, castle sieges, forest blazes, monster lairs and flooded swamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to units to transform them into a blade whirlwind, a master of undeath or a titan of strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a full campaign that takes you through the story of soldiers standing against whatever evil the world brings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make meaningful choices on which missions to deploy on, who to helped first and see where your morals lay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful boss enemies that test your ability and defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the fantasy world and the forces that influence it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally against the dying of the light and be the bulwark of humanity.</strong> Fight waves of attackers and recruit a variety of characters utilising blades, hammers and firearms alongside those with more sinister  methods of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Each Level presents a new challenge. </strong>The decisions you make can effect what threats you face and where the story will take you. Each playthrough can be played differently with to see new routes and possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A simple and expanding game. </strong>As a solo developer the low poly art style and modular level structure means new content will be added at a steady pace will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open to feedback and suggestions. </strong>Reviews, Steam Community, Discord server and all the associated social media links are constantly used. So new features and ideas will help help shape development.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/880a2dfd4a20bc463fe7825262243032.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hope Company is a Fantasy medieval wave attack game based on combat and a evolving story. </strong>Taking inspiration from Bloon's Tower Defence 6, Mud and Blood and Battle Brothers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the game you start as a Mercenary company commander.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a range of damage dealers, immovable tanks, healers and supporters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle environments like snowy hills, castle sieges, forest blazes, monster lairs and flooded swamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to units to transform them into a blade whirlwind, a master of undeath or a titan of strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a full campaign that takes you through the story of soldiers standing against whatever evil the world brings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make meaningful choices on which missions to deploy on, who to helped first and see where your morals lay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful boss enemies that test your ability and defences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the fantasy world and the forces that influence it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.poster.avif?t=1774558156\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.webm?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/extras/7ee1db555162c67947a542d356b49702.mp4?t=1774558156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally against the dying of the light and be the bulwark of humanity.</strong> Fight waves of attackers and recruit a variety of characters utilising blades, hammers and firearms alongside those with more sinister  methods of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Each Level presents a new challenge. </strong>The decisions you make can effect what threats you face and where the story will take you. Each playthrough can be played differently with to see new routes and possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A simple and expanding game. </strong>As a solo developer the low poly art style and modular level structure means new content will be added at a steady pace will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open to feedback and suggestions. </strong>Reviews, Steam Community, Discord server and all the associated social media links are constantly used. So new features and ideas will help help shape development.</p>", "short_description": "Be the bulwark of humanity, fight waves of attackers and command your mercenary company through a world in dire need of heroes. By swords, arrows, bullets or bombs carve a path to victory. But what are you willing to do to succeed? To fight monsters, how much humanity will you sacrifice for victory?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844870/dd1c805138bd20f20a19709e